{"id": "86300", "name": "Complex_Fifth_Roots", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Determine a fifth root of \\(z = {{CT:0}} \\) in the form \\( p + q i \\).</p>\n<p>You may use the commands \\( \\cos() \\) and \\( \\sin() \\) in your answers.</p>\n<p><br />\\( p + q i =\\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-complex\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: the imaginary unit \\(i\\) is typed as the letter <code dir=\"ltr\">i</code> (or <code dir=\"ltr\">%i</code>), and multiplication with a star. For example <code dir=\"ltr\">3-2*i</code>.</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>For the complex number \\[z = {{CT:0}}\\] The modulus \\(|z| = {{CT:1}}\\) and the argument of \\(z = {{CT:2}}\\) <br /> Therefore the cube roots of \\(z\\) have a modulus of \\[\\sqrt[3]{z} = \\sqrt[3]{{CT:1}} = {{CT:3}}\\] \\[\\] The arguments of \\(z = {{CT:2}}\\) or \\({{CT:4}}\\) or \\({{CT:5}}\\) <br /> Giving the arguments of the cube roots as \\( \\frac{{CT:2}}{3}\\) ,\\(\\frac{{CT:4}}{3}\\) and \\(\\frac{{CT:5}}{3}\\) equal to \\({{CT:6}}\\),\\({{CT:7}}\\),\\({{CT:8}}\\).</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correctAns\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 50, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "check1:ev(subst(%pi,pi,ans1^5),numer,expand);\nserr:if(cabs(ev(check1-znum,simp))<10^(-10)) then 1 else 0;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "serr", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["absz", "argz", "fr", "ns", "sol1", "sol2", "sol3", "sol4", "sol5", "sola1", "sola2", "sola3", "sola4", "sola5", "soli", "soli2", "soli3", "soli4", "soli5", "solm", "solr", "solr2", "solr3", "solr4", "solr5", "wr2", "wr3", "wri2", "wri3", "wrm", "wrong1", "wrong2", "wrong3", "wrr2", "wrr3", "z", "zi", "znum", "zr"], "nvariants": 50}